; Clears the bits of sprites 0-4 in sprite_enable_shadow. Only sprite 4 gets 0 in sprite_anim and sprite_path: the loop does not load 0 again, so sprites 3-0 get the new sprite_enable_shadow value there.
hide_sprites_0_to_4
